    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manase kūbiza ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Manase walī na myaka ikūmi n'ībīlī aho alandya kūbiza ntemi, ūsuga alī mu Yelusalemu ikanza lya myaka makūmi atanò n'ītanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akīīta yabūbi no ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, kūlwa kūlondeela nhūngwa ja mahanga ga banhū abo SEEBA walī wabapeeja gīkī babīngīle a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgazenga hangī a mapandī ga higūlya ayo ise Hezekia walī wagakenaagūla, ūzenga na ng'walīlo kūlwa lī Baalī, ūbeeja na ng'hīngī ya lī Ashela, na a mabità ga sonda ja ng'wigūlū a gose waginamīlaga na kūgalamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA ūzenga myalīlo, īyo ū SEEBA walī wahaya, “Ī lina lyane līkūbiza mu Yelusalemu shikū jose welelo na welelo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gwalugwa ja ha hekalu būbīlī wajo ūzenga myalīlo kūlwa nguno ya mabità gose ga sonda ja ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na bitūnja bakwe ūūkabapemba mu moto mu longa lwa Hinomu, kūlwa kūbafunya shitambò; nīyo ūbiza munhū wa kūyūtūmamīlī nguzu ja mu giiti, ī ya būchembelwa wa ngoko, nī ya būlogi yūbiza yakwe, ūyūkooba na būgunanhwa kūfuma kū banhū ba masamvwa ga būlagūji, na myoyo misoso ya mbika jingī na jingī. Ūmpelanya no ū SEEBA nguno ya mihayo ya malofu ī yose īyo wīyītaga ū mu miso gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī wasula shiikolile sha Līashela; hūna ūshisola ūshitūūla mu hekalu, īyo ū SEEBA walī wang'wīla ū Daūdi nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Solomoni, “Ī lina lyane nakūlītūūla ilalī ū mu hekalu yenīyī, nū mu nzengo gwa Yelusalemu ūyo naagūsolile kūfuma mu ng'anda jose ja Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli ūlū būbiza bilang'hani, na bīshikīlīja mu welwa ng'holò pyī īyo naabalagīla kūlwa shilagīlo ī shose, na a malange, na katongeelele, gīt'ūmo wabinhīla Musa, natalajileka hangī ī mhambala jabo jishimīze kūja ūko na ūko, kwīnga ū mu sī īyo naabagabīla bakūlūgenji bing'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo īkī ū Manase walī wabatūnja kūngī a banhū ba Yuda na a ba Yelusalemu, nose ū būbi ūbo baalī bawīta walī būtaale no, kūgatinda na a mahanga ayo SEEBA walī wagayagaja gīkī gabīngīle a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA walī wa kūlūngalūnga nū Manase hamò na a banhū bakwe, ndūhū batagemile ū kūndīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū nose ū SEEBA ūbenhela mabità ga ntemi wa Ashulu na bataale bago; būndima ū Manase, būngwasha itendele ū mu lyūūlū, hama būntunga na mboyo ja shaba hūna būntwala Babuloni mu būtungwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alī mu makoye kūlwa būtungwa bokwe, ūnīlīīla ū SEEBA Mulungu wakwe gīkī anchīle shigongo; nīyo widoohya no ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wanomba ū SEEBA, SEEBA nang'hwe ūnsaatwa ū mu kūlīla kwakwe, ūng'wigwa ū kūlomba kwakwe; ūnshosha hangī ī Yelusalemu, na a ha būtemi bokwe. Hūna ū Manase ūmana ī gīkī ū SEEBA alī Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manase kwībeeja īyo yalī yabiipa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu makanza malebe wīzenga būpya ī ndugu ya hanze ī ya kūgūpīndīlīja ū nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi, ū kū lwandī lwa ng'weli ya Gihoni, ū kū longa. Ī ndugu yenīyo wīzenga kūshisha ūshika kū mita gwa ndīlo; ūlūpīndīlīja pyī ī lūgūlū lwa Ofeeli, nīyo wīlīhya ū kūja ū ng'wigūlya. Hama ū mu mizengo ya Yuda ī yose īyo yalī īpīndīlījiwe ndugu ūtūūla mo bataale ba bashilikale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a mamulungu ga nyageni ūgīnja, na līshiikolile walī walītūūla ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, ūlīfunya moi; na myalīlo walī wazenga a ha lūgūlū lwa hekalu nū mu Yelusalemu, nayo wīyīnja; pye a genaya ūgaponya hanze ya nzengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūgūbeeja būpya ū ng'walīlo go ng'wa SEEBA, hūna ūfunya hoi shakwinha sha būsangī na sha kūlūmba. Ūbawīla a banhū ba Yuda kūntūmamīla SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a hene a banhū baalī bataalī būfunya shitambò ū kū mapandī ga higūlya; nūūlū īkī bamfunījaga SEEBA Mulungu wabo dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Manase, nū būlombi wakwe ūbo akanomba ū Mulungu wakwe, nī mihayo īyo baboni bang'wīlaga mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wa Isilaeli; ī yose yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūlomba kwakwe nū mumo ū SEEBA akang'wigwa ū mu kūlīla kwakwe, nū būkenaagūji wakwe ū bose, nū būgaya wishigwa, na a mapandī ga higūlya ayo akagazenga, ūtūūla na makīngī ga Līashela, nī shiikolile īsho walī wibeegeja aho ataalī kwidoohya; ī yose yenīyo yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'wa Hozai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hozai:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shandikwa sha Shiyunani shihayile “Baboni”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Manase wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkwa ng'wikūlū lyakwe. Ng'witūnja wakwe Amoni ūbiza ntemi a ha ng'wanya gwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amoni ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Amoni aho alandya kūbiza ntemi walī na myaka makūmi abīlī n'ībīlī, ūsuga ū mu Yelusalemu ikanza lya myak'ībīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, gīt'ūmo ise Manase walī wītīla. Ū Amoni ūyūshilamya na kūshitūmamīla pyī ī shiikolile īsho walī washibeeja ise Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū wei atidoohije ūmo ise akidooheja kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA; ū Amoni akongeja dūhū ū kūbiza wabūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose batūmami bakwe būnīīla gwīnda, būmūlagīla ng'wikūlū lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
